# Frontend Cockpit Engineering Rules (ares-cockpit)

1. Ergonomics: Strictly pure black OLED theme (`#000000`) with high contrast (Emerald green for nominal, Amber for warning, Red for critical violation).
2. Human Factors: Minimum touch target size $48 \times 48\text{ px}$. Minimum font size $14\text{ px}$.
3. Header: Always display the tri-phase status bar: `[1. GATHER] -> [2. EVALUATE] -> [3. ACT]`.
4. WebSocket Communication: Connect to `ws://127.0.0.1:8080/ws` with automatic reconnection backoff. Process 20 Hz state updates.
5. 3D WebGL Visualization:
   - Use `pmndrs/react-three-fiber` and `three.js`.
   - Wireframe holographic human mesh with 5 emissive organ nodes (Skull, Neck, Chest, Calf, Calcaneus) mapped to normalized STL margins.
   - Animated dynamic Bezier causal arcs.
6. Playbook Execution:
   - Enforce hard safety gates (anticoagulation lockout on isolated stasis; LBNP auto-vent on systolic drop > 15 mmHg).
